## Tables

```javascript
slide.addTable([
  ["Header 1", "Header 2"],
  ["Cell 1", "Cell 2"]
], {
  x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 2,
  border: { pt: 1, color: "999999" }, fill: { color: "F1F1F1" }
});

